---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import site from '../../config/site.json';
---
<Layout title="Terms of Use and Disclaimer" description="Terms of use for the free calculators on Smart Tools Hub: results are for reference only, how legal figures are kept up to date, and how ads and affiliate links work." lang="en" alternate="/dieu-khoan">
  <article class="prose-lite card max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p>By using {site.siteNameEn} you agree to these terms. All tools are free and need no account.</p>
    <h2>Results are for reference only</h2>
    <p>Salary, tax, social insurance, fee and utility calculations follow the Vietnamese legal documents cited on each tool and are reviewed regularly. Rules change and individual cases differ, so results do not replace advice from a lawyer, accountant or the relevant authority. The official amount is the one set by the competent body.</p>
    <h2>Cultural and entertainment content</h2>
    <p>Lunar calendar, auspicious days, numerology and tarot reflect folk traditions and are for cultural and entertainment purposes only.</p>
    <h2>Ads and affiliate links</h2>
    <p>The site may show labelled ads and affiliate links. We may earn a commission when you buy through them, at no extra cost to you. We are not responsible for third-party products or services.</p>
    <h2>Report an error</h2>
    <p>Found a wrong figure? Tell us via the <a href="/en/contact">Contact</a> page. See also our <a href="/en/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
